  "body": "Enjoy the best of coastal living at 12D Rewi Street, Torbay, where elevated positioning, beautiful sea views and a thoughtfully designed layout come together to create a home you'll love.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned to capture the coastal outlook, this inviting home offers a wonderful sense of space, light and relaxation. Whether you're enjoying your morning coffee with a sea view or unwinding after a day at the beach, this is a lifestyle opportunity that's hard to resist.\r\n\r\nThe well-considered floor plan features two separate living areas, providing flexibility for families of all stages. Create a dedicated family lounge, a quiet retreat or an additional space for entertaining guests - there's room for everyone to enjoy their own space.\r\n\r\nEveryday living is made easy with a practical design that balances comfort, functionality and modern lifestyle needs.\r\n\r\nWith the beach within walking distance, spontaneous seaside strolls, refreshing morning walks and relaxed weekends by the water can become part of your everyday routine. Enjoy the charm of Torbay's coastal surroundings while making the most of everything this sought-after neighbourhood has to offer.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n- Elevated position with beautiful sea views\r\n- Walking distance to the beach\r\n- Practical and well-designed floor plan\r\n- Two separate living areas for added flexibility\r\n- A relaxed coastal lifestyle in sought-after Torbay\r\n\r\nWhether you're searching for a comfortable family home or a property that embraces the beauty of coastal living, 12D Rewi Street is well worth your inspection.\r\n\r\n***50/50 conjuctional with all agents!",
